@startuml
title Inventory Management System

[*] --> AddGoodsToInventory

state "Add Goods to Inventory" as AddGoodsToInventory
state "Update Price of Existing Items" as UpdatePriceOfExistingItems
state "Remove Expired Goods from Inventory" as RemoveExpiredGoodsFromInventory
state "Notify User about Removal of Expired Goods" as NotifyUserAboutRemovalOfExpiredGoods

AddGoodsToInventory --> UpdatePriceOfExistingItems : add goods to inventory
UpdatePriceOfExistingItems --> RemoveExpiredGoodsFromInventory : update price of existing items
RemoveExpiredGoodsFromInventory --> NotifyUserAboutRemovalOfExpiredGoods : remove expired goods from inventory
NotifyUserAboutRemovalOfExpiredGoods --> [*] : notify user about removal of expired goods

state "Place Order to Supplier" as PlaceOrderToSupplier
state "Generate Invoice for Order" as GenerateInvoiceForOrder
state "Allow User to Search and Select Items for Purchase" as AllowUserToSearchAndSelectItemsForPurchase
state "Calculate Discount and Tax on Selected Items" as CalculateDiscountAndTaxOnSelectedItems

PlaceOrderToSupplier --> GenerateInvoiceForOrder : place order to supplier
GenerateInvoiceForOrder --> AllowUserToSearchAndSelectItemsForPurchase : generate invoice for order
AllowUserToSearchAndSelectItemsForPurchase --> CalculateDiscountAndTaxOnSelectedItems : allow user to search and select items for purchase
CalculateDiscountAndTaxOnSelectedItems --> GenerateReceiptForCustomer : calculate discount and tax on selected items

state "Generate Receipt for Customer" as GenerateReceiptForCustomer
state "Record Customer Requests for Unavailable Items" as RecordCustomerRequestsForUnavailableItems
state "Allow User to Replace Item or Cancel Receipt During Billing Process" as AllowUserToReplaceItemOrCancelReceiptDuringBillingProcess

GenerateReceiptForCustomer --> RecordCustomerRequestsForUnavailableItems : generate receipt for customer
RecordCustomerRequestsForUnavailableItems --> AllowUserToReplaceItemOrCancelReceiptDuringBillingProcess : record customer requests for unavailable items
AllowUserToReplaceItemOrCancelReceiptDuringBillingProcess --> [*] : allow user to replace item or cancel receipt during billing process

state "View Summary Report of All Transactions" as ViewSummaryReportOfAllTransactions

[*] --> ViewSummaryReportOfAllTransactions : view summary report of all transactions

@enduml
